  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> Farum is charged.</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You invoke Shiral to channel Farum’s magic and command your next spell to be charged with a different form of ether emblematic of a tradition. You cast a runic cantrip or spell with its number of actions, and you can change its damage type and traits from its original type to force, spirit, fire or mental. Farum is no longer charged.</p>"
